# The unix.stdin inlet check (tests/stdin-inlet): descriptor 0 is the inlet,
# whose ring the launcher lends (CuBit.Inlet_Rings). Its ring is 4 pages, far
# smaller than what the launcher sends, so nothing arrives unless the
# launcher waits for this reader.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.stdin-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  optional => ["logstore"]
  requests => [(service "logstore" "logstore")]
  inlets => [(Inlet "unix.stdin" Element.Raw_Bytes pages => 4)]
  descriptors => [(Descriptor 0 "unix.stdin")])
